meta {
  name: LxxSeedImport
  type: http
  seq: 32
}

post {
  url: {{url}}maintainer/lxx/seed/import
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "mirror": false
  }
}

docs {
  Imports assets/seed/lxx/tags.csv and links.csv in the background (roadmap 0028.8). Lines whose LXX word is gone or whose hash changed are skipped and listed (anchorMismatch). mirror false: insert missing, update differing or proposed tags, never delete. mirror true (Exakt wie Datei): also delete confirmed tags and links the files lack; proposals stay. 202 with the job (operation lxxSeedImport); 409; 422; 401; 403. Poll SeedStatus.
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
}
